<title>USA: Ag-Chem names Don Pottinger president.</title>
<headline>Ag-Chem names Don Pottinger president.</headline>
<dateline>MINNETONKA, Minn. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ag-Chem Equipment Co Inc, an off-road chassis maker, said Tuesday Don pottinger has bene named president of the company.</p>
<p>A.E. McQuinn continues in his positions as chief executive officer and chairman of the board of Ag-Chem Equipment Co Inc, as well as president and chief executive of all Ag-Chem subsidiaries.</p>
<p>Pottinger had been vice president for wroldwide sales and service.</p>
<p>	 ((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
